PWM for FORTE on Linux (new module pwmsysfs): a PWMChip config FB per /sys/class/pwm channel,
used with the standard QW output FB (0..65535 = fraction of the period). Enable with
FORTE_MODULE_PWMSYSFS=ON. For the Raspberry Pi's hardware PWM (dtoverlay=pwm-2chan) or any other
Linux PWM driver (e.g. a PCA9685 board). Applied by build-runtime.ps1.

